    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are delighted to present No. 28 Belgium Park, Monaghan to the market.\n\nThis charming two-bedroom residence is constructed of attractive original cut stone, offering the the character of Belgium Park.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, guest WC, kitchen and living room at ground floor level. Upstairs, there are two bedrooms, a bathroom and a spacious landing area.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a paved area to the front providing off-street parking, bordered by a low stone wall and mature planting. To the rear is an enclosed paved courtyard garden, offering a private outdoor space with a useful outbuilding providing additional storage.\n\nBelgium Park offers a strong sense of community while being just a short stroll from the town centre, schools, shops and a wide range of local amenities.\n\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor, No. 28 Belgium Park presents an excellent opportunity to secure a home in this ever-popular address.\n\nViewing by appointment only with the agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nWelcoming entrance hall providing access to the ground floor accommodation.\n\nGuest WC/ Shower Room: - \nComprising WC, wash hand basin and a spacious walk-in shower with electric shower, complete with tiled flooring.\n\nLiving Room: - \nBright living room with wooden flooring and an attractive exposed brick fireplace. Double doors open directly onto the rear courtyard, allowing an abundance of natural light.\n\nKitchen: - \nA contemporary fitted kitchen, with ample worktop space and stainless steel sink. Complete with tiled-effect flooring.\n\nLanding: - \nSpacious landing area with wooden flooring and built-in shelving, offering potential for conversion to a third bedroom, (subject to the necessary planning permissions.)\n\nBedroom 1: - \nBright and spacious double bedroom with wooden flooring, feature fireplace and a large window providing plenty of natural light.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nBright and well-proportioned bedroom with wooden flooring and window overlooking the rear.\n\nBathroom: - \nComprising bath with electric shower over, WC and wash hand basin, with tiled walls and flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total Floor Area: 94 sq. mts. (1012 sq ft) approximately</li><li>Original cut stone façade, full of character</li><li>Located in a mature and well-established residential area</li><li>Long-standing community with many original owners</li><li>Scope to create a third bedroom - subject to the suitable planning permissions</li><li>Monaghan town centre on your door step as well as,</li><li>Bus Station, Lidl, Londis Peace Campus </li><li>Excellent opportunity for first-time buyers or investors</li><li>Hi-speed broadband available</li><li>Oil Fired Central Heating</ul>"
      },
